{"summary":"Relax, deliver goods, upgrade wagons, and enjoy beautiful landscapes!","description":"Embark on a tranquil journey with Train Delivery Simulator, the ultimate game for train enthusiasts! Immerse yourself in a relaxing and visually stunning world where your mission is to efficiently manage and operate a freight train. Strategically choose and purchase new wagons to optimize your train's load, ensuring you deliver goods to various locations seamlessly.\n\nUpgrade your train's engine to handle increased load capacities and enhance your earning potential with each successful delivery. Each location completed brings a new sense of accomplishment and a step closer to becoming the ultimate train delivery master.\n\nWith a focus on a serene atmosphere and breathtaking scenery, Train Delivery Simulator offers a satisfying gameplay experience that will keep you hooked. Whether you're a casual gamer or a hardcore train fan, this game provides a perfect blend of strategy and relaxation.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- Beautiful graphics and relaxing gameplay\n- Manage and upgrade your train with new wagons and powerful engines\n- Strategize to maximize efficiency and earnings\n- Complete challenging levels and unlock new locations\n- Perfect for train enthusiasts and casual gamers alike\n\nDownload Train Delivery Simulator now and start your journey across picturesque landscapes, delivering goods and achieving greatness!\n\nIGRS rating: 13+","esrbNotes":"Mild Violence","pegiNotes":"Implied Violence","iapPrices":"$1.99 - $79.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gbWkD0p6bYc?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/R_t7sbk9sh7cjHlhFrJWGRw4eivyCrqn55-9019qOarqU7DUuOSoqdZPWsbKRiY1brHfBQ1eFIR_hW3PSIl7gm8","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gbi2oz-v6TvTB9UxaWeD0wtHox_gz43Ee0U8yxP3HrCXY11pkIpy_W8PZQm4VePm2qm8LBTMEsJBC4Ug8cE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6NpBjVQ3SCiVvSjPtjhM7K9dvidY8vJ1MsGhTRKQCQX